{"id":"vod_sn_36208","vodId":"36208","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"少女革命","name_cn":"少女革命","date":"1997-01-01","year":"1997","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/3b51e90b2ef93e814c52be7df8ccf8f4.jpg"},"summary":"天上欧蒂娜（川上伦子 配音）从小就失去了父母，某日，她遇见了一位英俊的王子，王子交给了欧蒂娜一枚戒指，告诉她这枚戒指或许能够使他们在遥远的未来再次相遇。王子英俊的身姿和温柔的话语在欧蒂娜的内心留下了深刻的印象，她希望自己最终也能如此优雅。　　在戒指的指引下，欧蒂娜进入了凤学园就读，在这里，流行着名为一个王子游戏，在决斗中获胜的一方可以得到“蔷薇新娘”姬宫安茜（渊崎有里子 配音），成为她的支配者。西园寺荚一（草尾毅 饰）是安茜目前的主人，然而，欧蒂娜最终将他打败，得到了安茜，随着时间的推移，欧蒂娜和安茜之间产生了深厚的情义。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:41:14","playable":true,"episodeCount":39,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/K3JPNxNuKk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hBUmcHSgYC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aDbpVK82LT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uavY8ETpZC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HVGewQSxR61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3tBXdXd9EN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/e4pnbTHzwg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nCwCszUsXj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nj9Cv2xpfV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TygiDgMtCW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/X9mqFJHXUW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hwL6ZGEmK01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sf6ep1rCzX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/q6BM3BRwCW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6